{
  "id": "6a8d0534a46ad39381f10c36",
  "title": "敬語一覧",
  "created": 1787626880,
  "updated": 1787631952,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a8d0534a46ad39381f10c36",
      "text": "敬語一覧",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787626880,
      "updated": 1787626880
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d058000000000007f88ed",
      "text": "表にするとなんか面白い知見を得られそう[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787626880,
      "updated": 1787626898
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d059200000000007f88ef",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787626898,
      "updated": 1787626898
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d059200000000007f88f0",
      "text": "table:敬語",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787626898,
      "updated": 1787626916
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d05a400000000007f88f1",
      "text": " 基本\t活用\t丁寧\t尊敬\t尊敬\t謙譲\t謙譲\t謙譲",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787626916,
      "updated": 1787631527
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d077800000000007f8906",
      "text": " \t\t[連用]ます\t御[連用]になる\t特殊\t[未然]させて頂く\t漢語する\tお〇〇する\t特殊",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787627385,
      "updated": 1787631526
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d078700000000007f8907",
      "text": " する\tサ変\tします\t\tされる・なさる\tさせて頂く\t\t\t致す",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628016,
      "updated": 1787631652
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d078700000000007f8908",
      "text": " 言う\t五段\t言います\t\t仰る\t言わせて頂く\t\t\t申す・申し上げる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787627399,
      "updated": 1787631525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0d8300000000007f891e",
      "text": " 行く\t五段\t行きます\t\tいらっしゃる\t行かせて頂く\t\t\t伺う・参る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628932,
      "updated": 1787631525
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0d9100000000007f8920",
      "text": " 来る\tカ変\t来ます\tお越しになる\tいらっしゃる\t\t\t\t伺う・参る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628945,
      "updated": 1787631524
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0d9900000000007f8922",
      "text": " 来る\tカ変\t来ます\tお見えになる\tいらっしゃる\t\t\t\t伺う・参る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628953,
      "updated": 1787631523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0dab00000000007f8925",
      "text": " 来る\tカ変\t来ます\tお出でになる\tいらっしゃる\t\t\t\t伺う・参る",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628972,
      "updated": 1787631523
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d120e00000000007f8966",
      "text": " 居る\t上一\tいます\tお出でになる\tいらっしゃる\t居させて頂く\t\t\tおる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630095,
      "updated": 1787631522
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0dac00000000007f8926",
      "text": " 食べ\t下一\t食べます\tお食べになる\t召し上がる\t食べさせて頂く\t頂戴する\t\t頂く",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628972,
      "updated": 1787631522
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d082a00000000007f8912",
      "text": " 読む\t五段\t読みます\tお読みになる\t\t読ませて頂く\t拝読する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787627563,
      "updated": 1787631521
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0ecb00000000007f894d",
      "text": " 見る\t上一\t見ます\tご覧になる\t\t見させて頂く\t拝見する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629259,
      "updated": 1787631521
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0ecb00000000007f894e",
      "text": " 聞く\t上一\t聞きます\tお聞きになる\t\t聞かせて頂く\t拝聴する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629259,
      "updated": 1787631520
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d135800000000007f897e",
      "text": " 帰る\t五段\t帰ります\tお帰りになる\t\t帰らせて頂く\t御暇する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630424,
      "updated": 1787631520
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d135800000000007f897f",
      "text": " 帰る\t五段\t帰ります\tお帰りになる\t\t帰らせて頂く\t失礼する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630424,
      "updated": 1787631519
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0dfc00000000007f892a",
      "text": " 着る\t上一\t着ます\tお召しになる\t\t着させて頂く\t\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629053,
      "updated": 1787631519
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0b9000000000007f8918",
      "text": " 会う\t五段\t会います\tお会いになる\t\t会わせて頂く\t\tお目に掛かる\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628433,
      "updated": 1787631518
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0b9100000000007f8919",
      "text": " 会う\t五段\t会います\tお会いになる\t\t会わせて頂く\t\tお会いする\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787628433,
      "updated": 1787631518
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d128300000000007f8968",
      "text": " 持つ\t五段\t持ちます\tお持ちになる\t\t持たせて頂く\t\tお持ちする\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630212,
      "updated": 1787631517
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d169000000000007f89af",
      "text": " 受取\t五段\t受取ます\tお受取になる\t\t受取せて頂く\t拝受する\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631249,
      "updated": 1787631517
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d169000000000007f89b0",
      "text": " 伝える\t下一\t伝えます\tお伝えになる\t\t伝えさせて頂く\t\t\t申し伝える",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631249,
      "updated": 1787631516
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d129400000000007f8977",
      "text": " 思う\t五段\t思います\tお思いになる\t思し召す\t\t\t\t存じる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630229,
      "updated": 1787631515
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d135f00000000007f8989",
      "text": " 与える\t下一\t与えます\tお与えになる\t下さる\t\t差上げる\t\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787630431,
      "updated": 1787631515
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d112e00000000007f8962",
      "text": " 貰う\t五段\t貰います\t\t\t\t頂戴する\t\t頂く",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629871,
      "updated": 1787631514
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d0f6700000000007f894f",
      "text": " 分かる\t五段\t\t\t\t\t承知する\t\t畏まる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629415,
      "updated": 1787631514
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d10e500000000007f895c",
      "text": " 知る\t五段\t\t\tご存知\t\t承知する\t\t存じる・存じ上げる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629798,
      "updated": 1787631513
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d10e500000000007f895f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787629798,
      "updated": 1787629798
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d18c900000000007f89b1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631818,
      "updated": 1787631818
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d18dd00000000007f89b2",
      "text": "いらっしゃる：いらせらる（下二段）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631838,
      "updated": 1787631847
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d18ef00000000007f89b4",
      "text": "\tいる + as + el + al ?",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631856,
      "updated": 1787631910
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d193f00000000007f89b5",
      "text": "\t\tいる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631936,
      "updated": 1787631938
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d194100000000007f89b6",
      "text": "\t\tいらす",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631938,
      "updated": 1787631941
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d194300000000007f89b7",
      "text": "\t\tいらせる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631941,
      "updated": 1787631942
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d194600000000007f89b8",
      "text": "\t\tいらせらる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631942,
      "updated": 1787631947
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d194c00000000007f89b9",
      "text": "\t\tいらっしゃる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1787631949,
      "updated": 1787631952
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8d18df00000000007f89b3",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
